  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38270d42d1aec5f44b78177f35140059, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Intro_TextDisplay
  textComponent: {fileID: 452644868106675532}
  introTexts:
  - The first step towards freedom is always a painful one.
  - The euphoric feeling could only ease your pain for a short duration.
  - 'Maybe it is enough for some. But like a swamp:'
  - "The more you struggle\r\nThe more you need it\r\nThe deeper you sink\u2026"
  - With your own will and strength, you must overcome the leash that continues to
    tighten around your neck.
  - With your own will and strength, you must overcome the leash that continues to
    tighten around your neck.
  - You might feel lost; there is no leash to guide you. No owner holding that leash
    tells you what to do.
  - But now the world is your oyster
  - <link="_GoodEnd_BG"></link>
  delaySeconds: 5
  introTextID: 0
  startOnAwake: 1
